  "id": "assistive-software",
  "term": "assistive software",
  "definition": "Assistive software is software designed to help people carry out complex tasks more efficiently by combining automated processing with human review. In the source, it refers to tools and interfaces for image processing, tracking, and data review that reduced labour in time-lapse microscopy studies.",
